OL,3,GNEWSADig to unearth the lost world of
OL,4,Amedieval leprosy
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has long been thought of as one of
OL,7,Fthe most feared diseases in the
OL,8,Fmedieval world.
OL,10,FLeprosy was capable of inspiring
OL,11,Freligious debate and, for those who
OL,12,Fbore its symptoms, reshaping their
OL,13,Fplace in society.
OL,15,FBut an archaeological project in
OL,16,FLincoln is presenting a more complex
OL,17,Fpicture of how this misunderstood
OL,18,Fcondition was treated and patients were
OL,19,Fperceived.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
