OL,3,GNEWSADig to unearth the lost world of
OL,4,Amedieval leprosy
OL,5,
OL,6,FNext month, a dig will begin to uncover
OL,7,Fthe Hospital of the Holy Innocents,
OL,8,Fwhich was founded in about the year
OL,9,F1100 to offer care and shelter to those
OL,10,Fliving with the disease.
